# Run B (user 2026-11-05: "keep expert buffer and rl buffer and sample from both"):
# the online-freeze fine-tune with a MIXED REPLAY -- one change from
# il_finetune_c0_freeze.env (job 463472).
#
# 463472 kept one replay with the expert steps preloaded into it, so its batches
# at the unfreeze were ~88% expert rows: the critic barely saw the clone's own
# states, and in the 1M-row ring the expert rows would be evicted first. Here
# the 403k recorded expert steps live in a replay of their own and every update
# draws half its chunks from it and half from the agent's own (RLPD's symmetric
# sampling). The trunk trains as in 463472; run A (il_finetune_c0_trunk.env)
# freezes it instead.
. "$REPO/slurm/il_finetune_c0_freeze.env"
export IL_EXPERT_FRAC=0.5
